OL,3,GNEWSASewage sparks no swim advice at
OL,4,Acity bathing spots
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water is being urged to fix
OL,7,Funpermitted sewage discharge in a major
OL,8,Fwaterway as a "matter of urgency".
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency said following
OL,11,Fan inspection of a treatment works it
OL,12,Fhad issued advice against swimming at
OL,13,Ftwo popular bathing areas on Plymouth
OL,14,FHoe.
OL,16,FIt said it had identified "operational
OL,17,Fissues" at a plant on the River Plym,
OL,18,Fincluding unpermitted sewage discharge
OL,19,Ffrom a storm overflow, which one of the
OL,20,Fcity's MPs described as "a dramatic
OL,21,Ffailure of South West Water to protect
OL,22,Four water quality".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
